1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Every inspection begins with a person — and surfaces that can't always be assessed from the outside.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,000
A sterile processing professional, an instrument, and increasingly complex lumened tools to inspect.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:25,000
Using a compatible borescope, the technician examines the lumen directly — inside LumenAI the borescope is an image source, capturing representative evidence without leaving the inspection.

4
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:31,000
The physical inspection becomes a structured digital record — technician, instrument, and lumen image flowing into LumenAI.

5
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:37,000
Designed for compatible borescope and camera sources — standardized inspection evidence, and an inspection can hold several representative images.

6
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:47,000
The image becomes structured evidence — image quality, AI-assisted analysis, and comparison with an available governed baseline, surfacing information for review.

7
00:00:47,000 --> 00:01:00,000
When an inspection needs review, LumenAI routes the evidence to a supervisor, who reviews images, baseline, AI-assisted observations, and history before recording the decision. AI assists. People decide.

8
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:08,000
Inspection, evidence, AI-assisted information, baseline, supervisor review, and disposition become one governed, auditable record.

9
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:16,000
Manufacturers, vendors, and organizations contribute reference information through a governed pathway — submit, verify, approve, publish. Never auto-approved.

10
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:23,000
Each inspection becomes part of the instrument's longitudinal history — Pass, Fair, and Review results over time.

11
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:29,000
Across a department, that history becomes trends — Pass, Fair, and Review activity, and how complete the evidence is.

12
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:35,000
Patterns emerge across instrument families — volume, results, recurring observations, review activity, and baseline coverage.

13
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:43,000
Documented inspections and decisions inform maintenance and replacement trends — operational and cost intelligence, evaluated with validated organizational data. Never invented savings.

14
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:49,000
The same evidence serves SPD, quality, and executive leaders — LumenAI is the intelligence and evidence layer, not just a borescope app.

15
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:56,000
One inspection becomes evidence. Evidence becomes history. History becomes intelligence. LumenAI — Inspection Intelligence for Sterile Processing.
